---
title: Milestone planning
---
flowchart TD
    classDef human fill:#fff3cd,stroke:#8a6d3b,color:#000
    classDef role fill:#d9edf7,stroke:#31708f,color:#000
    classDef channel fill:#dff0d8,stroke:#3c763d,color:#000
    classDef stop fill:#eeeeee,stroke:#777,color:#000

    START(["Human asks for the next task"]):::human
    QUEUE{"Any entry in .claude/problems.md<br/>not signed Created by: Architect?"}
    FIRST(["Those come first<br/>— see agent-flow-problem-lifecycle.mmd"]):::stop
    FINISHED{"Is the current milestone finished —<br/>every subtask done, no open problems,<br/>but not yet ✅ Done?"}
    ASK["Write no task. Say the milestone looks<br/>complete and ask the human whether to<br/>hand the tree to the Milestone Reviewer.<br/>Inventing filler work is the failure here"]:::stop
    UNCLEAR{"Is the milestone's shape<br/>settled enough to specify?"}

    ARCH["Architect<br/>investigates: options, dependencies,<br/>what the milestone actually requires"]:::role
    INV["The conclusion lands where it survives:<br/>docs/adr/**, the docs/ROADMAP.md entry<br/>itself, or CLAUDE.md"]:::channel

    TW["Task writer"]:::role
    READ["Reads the docs/ROADMAP.md entry:<br/>Problem, Solution, Done-when,<br/>plus any ADR it names"]
    ARCHIVE{"Is every subtask in the previous<br/>.claude/task.md at ✅ Done?<br/>👀 Review is not done"}
    MOVE["Move it to docs/tasks/&lt;milestone&gt;-&lt;slug&gt;.md.<br/>task.md is gitignored, so this archive is<br/>the only copy that survives"]
    KEEP["Leave it in place —<br/>it is still the live task"]:::stop

    SPLIT["Decompose into subtasks:<br/>each independently completable<br/>and independently reviewable"]
    ORDER["Order Plan, 1..N —<br/>if a subtask cannot finish without a<br/>later one, it is two subtasks misordered"]
    WRITE["Write .claude/task.md:<br/>title, Order Plan, one section per subtask<br/>with how to test it, every status at 🆕 New.<br/>No rationale — a decision worth explaining<br/>is an ADR, not a task"]
    TASK[".claude/task.md"]:::channel
    STATUS["Set the sub-milestone to 🚧 In Progress<br/>in docs/ROADMAP.md.<br/>At most one sub-milestone at a time"]
    ROADMAP["docs/ROADMAP.md"]:::channel
    NEXT(["Coder starts subtask 1<br/>— see agent-flow-task-implementation.mmd"]):::stop

    START --> QUEUE
    QUEUE -- yes --> FIRST
    QUEUE -- no --> FINISHED
    FINISHED -- yes --> ASK
    FINISHED -- no --> UNCLEAR
    UNCLEAR -- no --> ARCH --> INV --> TW
    UNCLEAR -- yes --> TW
    TW --> READ --> ARCHIVE
    ARCHIVE -- yes --> MOVE --> SPLIT
    ARCHIVE -- "no, subtasks still open" --> KEEP
    SPLIT --> ORDER --> WRITE --> TASK --> STATUS --> ROADMAP --> NEXT